  "public_contract": "Natural-language request review v1: Produce a reviewable draft from the entire current request. A draft grants no execution authority. Never execute the business task or approve your own draft. Submit the draft through rpe_propose when available; otherwise save model-generated JSON as draft.json using the native tools. The human user never has to write JSON. The draft has exactly capability, constraints, execution, requirements, unresolved. capability is a string, constraints is an array of registered contract flags, execution is an object, unresolved is an array of strings describing every unsupported, conflicting or missing requirement. Each requirements row has exactly text, quote, fields. text is a human-readable requirement; quote is an exact nonempty substring of the original request, or null for an explicitly proposed default. The parent labels these source_quote and proposed_default. A quote proves provenance only, never full semantic coverage. fields is an array of JSON pointers such as /capability, /constraints, /execution/input_path. Cover every proposed machine field and retain requirements beyond the available capability in unresolved. Never claim model extraction proves completeness or human approval. Paths are workspace relative. Preserve inputs and never overwrite. Available capabilities: tabular.deduplicate accepts csv or xlsx; it keeps first and preserves row order and cells. Required execution fields: input_path, output_path, key_columns. Optional execution fields: keep (first only), encoding, delimiter, sheet. Allowed constraints: preserve_original, preserve_order, preserve_formulas. json.normalize changes structural whitespace only, preserving number spelling, escapes and object/array order. Required and only execution fields: input_path, output_path, style (minify or pretty). Allowed constraints: preserve_original, preserve_order. Output ends with one LF. xlsx.inspect reads an existing xlsx workbook through the trusted installed xlsx adapter. Required execution fields: input_path, output_path, mode (rows, sheets or formulas). Optional execution field: sheet. Allowed constraint: preserve_original. Preserve the original helper JSON structure. The parent checks actual capability and adapter availability after drafting. Do not install, train, upgrade, or read controller files/databases/other sessions/reports/RPE implementation. Only a later explicit human confirmation of the displayed proposal can authorize execution.",
